{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "wavepulse-api-collection",
    "name": "WavePulse API",
    "description": "REST API endpoints for WavePulse debugging tool.\n\n## Usage\n1. First, get the Element Tree to find widget IDs\n2. Use the `id` field from the element tree (not `name`) for widget property/style lookups\n\n## Example Widget ID\nFrom element tree response:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"mainpage\",\n  \"tagName\": \"WmPage\",\n  \"id\": \"wm-app-content-mainpage\",\n  \"children\": [...]\n}\n```\nUse `wm-app-content-mainpage` as the widgetId parameter.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/wavepulse",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "channelId",
      "value": "c1764792232069",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "widgetId",
      "value": "mainpage",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Use the 'id' field from element tree response"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Element Tree",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Element Tree",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/element-tree?channelId={{channelId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "element-tree"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "channelId",
                  "value": "{{channelId}}",
                  "description": "The channel ID of the connected mobile app"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns the widget/element tree from the connected mobile app.\n\n**Response contains:**\n- `id` - Use this for widget property/style lookups\n- `name` - Display name of the widget\n- `tagName` - Widget type (WmPage, WmButton, etc.)\n- `children` - Nested child widgets"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
